OL,5,AGCSE results day
OL,6,
OL,7,FOur team of experts is currently
OL,8,Fanswering your questions on what to do
OL,9,Fnow you've received your GCSE results
OL,11,FThe overall pass rate has fallen
OL,12,Fslightly for the fifth year in a row -
OL,13,Fbut top grades have edged up across
OL,14,FEngland, Wales and Northern Ireland
OL,16,FThe gap between the pass rates for boys
OL,17,Fand girls across all three nations has
OL,18,Fnarrowed again, to its lowest point
OL,19,Fsince 2000
