OL,5,AGCSE results day
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of thousands of students have
OL,8,Fopened their GCSE, BTec and Cambridge
OL,9,FNationals results
OL,11,FChildhood best friends Jessie and Ellie
OL,12,Fare relieved with their grades and have
OL,13,Fthanked their "amazing teacher, Miss
OL,14,FEvie", while it's confetti, cheers and
OL,15,Fhappy tears at one school in Derby
OL,17,FAspiring dancer Finn "can't believe"
OL,18,Fhe's "passed everything", but not
OL,19,Feveryone getting their results is a
OL,20,Fteenager, as 52-year-old grandmother
OL,21,FWynne is "shocked" but "very happy" to
OL,22,Fhave passed her maths exam
